stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Closed
  Closed --> Preview: Open row, swipe, or selected cards / capture clock once
  Preview --> Preview: Refresh / retain endpoints
  Preview --> Closed: Cancel or Escape / restore opener focus
  Preview --> Expired: Select elapsed endpoint / refuse locally
  Expired --> Closed: Cancel or Escape
  Preview --> Pending: Select future endpoint / store exact command
  Pending --> Pending: Offline or uncertain result / retain command
  Pending --> Closed: Retry identical command / confirmed
  Closed --> Preview: Reopen / fresh endpoints
  Preview --> Retired: Session invalidated / unmount
  Pending --> Retired: Session invalidated / unmount
